<!--
  The reminder's small icon: the launcher's flower as a silhouette.

  The status bar draws a small icon from its alpha alone, in a colour it
  chooses, so this is one shape in opaque white on nothing. The launcher icon
  it replaces is opaque edge to edge and arrived as a grey square.

  Five petals and the heart that joins them, every circle wound the same way
  so they fill as one shape. Named in lib/reminders.dart, which is how
  ReminderIconTest finds it.
-->
